                "## Why RA-207? One maintenance event, three robots\n",
                "\n",
                "The J3-reducer drift on RA-207 began right after its quarterly grease PM. The same contractor greased **RA-211** and **RA-214** with the same non-OEM substitute (Mobilgrease XHP 222) while Vigo RE0 was backordered. RA-203 failed exactly this way six months ago (CAPA-0117). RA-201, greased in-house with RE0, is the control."
              ]
            }
